{"sectionId":"physics-fluid-thermal/fluid","items":[{"id":"physics-fluid-thermal--fluid-k001","sectionId":"physics-fluid-thermal/fluid","unitId":"physics-fluid-thermal","subject":"physics","text":"정지한 일정 밀도 유체에서 압력은 깊이에 따라 P=P₀+ρgh로 증가한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-fluid-thermal--fluid-k002","sectionId":"physics-fluid-thermal/fluid","unitId":"physics-fluid-thermal","subject":"physics","text":"Archimedes 부력은 밀어낸 유체의 무게 ρgV이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-fluid-thermal--fluid-k003","sectionId":"physics-fluid-thermal/fluid","unitId":"physics-fluid-thermal","subject":"physics","text":"비압축성 정상류에서 연속방정식 Av=constant가 성립하고 비점성 정상류의 유선을 따라 Bernoulli 식 P+ρv²/2+ρgh=constant를 사용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-fluid-thermal--fluid-k004","sectionId":"physics-fluid-thermal/fluid","unitId":"physics-fluid-thermal","subject":"physics","text":"점성 층류의 원통 관에서 Poiseuille 유량은 ΔPπr⁴/(8ηL)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-fluid-thermal--fluid-k005","sectionId":"physics-fluid-thermal/fluid","unitId":"physics-fluid-thermal","subject":"physics","text":"열평형과 온도, 열용량, 비열 및 잠열을 구별한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-fluid-thermal--fluid-k006","sectionId":"physics-fluid-thermal/fluid","unitId":"physics-fluid-thermal","subject":"physics","text":"이상기체의 내부에너지는 온도에만 의존한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]}